  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8403.02 Contact Persons",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8403.02 Contact Persons.\n\n(a) A person agreeing to be a designated contact person shall:\n\n(1) Sign the application, Form DSSP 470 or Form DSSP 471, whichever is applicable, indicating that they agree to be a designated contact to assist the specified person with a disability with communications during an encounter with law enforcement; and\n\n(2) Have their signature on the form notarized.\n\n(b) Contact persons shall update their contact information as necessary by completing Form DSSP 472 “Updating Information Regarding Contact Person”, effective 08/25, and:\n\n(1) Have their signature on the form notarized; and\n\n(2) The form shall be submitted pursuant to Saf-C 8403.01(d)(1)-(3).\n\n(c) Any person in Saf-C 8401.02(b) may designate a new contact person for a participating person to replace an existing contact person or to add a second contact person by completing form DSSP 473 “Replacing or Adding a Second Contact Person”, effective 08/25, and:\n\n(1) The applicant or participating person’s signature shall be notarized;\n\n(2) The contact person shall acknowledge that they agree to be a designated contact to assist the specified person with a disability with communications during an encounter with law enforcement;\n\n(3) The contact person’s signature shall be notarized; and\n\n(4) The form shall be submitted pursuant to Saf-C 8403.01(d)(1)-(3).\n\nSource. #14340, eff 8-14-25, EXPIRES: 8-14-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8400.html"
